  concept: "Authored objective: D2 Reverse Diode Blocked.\nAuthored requirement:
    Confirm the reverse-biased diode blocks current (0 to 0.05 mA). current \u2264
    0.05 mA. Connection pair D_REVERSE_Anode and D_REVERSE_Cathode.\nGeneral teaching
    principle: Diode behavior depends on polarity, operating point and its device
    characteristics.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that
    this objective is complete."
  analogy: A direction-sensitive valve is an approximation, not a complete semiconductor
    model.
  diagram: '[Authored setup] -> [Check prerequisites] -> [Observe the game evidence]
    -> [Verify objective]'
  misconception: Reverse bias and forward conduction must not be inferred from wire
    direction alone.
